  "baseline": "0b0984fc8efd340c76382f337a69aff01575555f",
  "status": "Improved common navigation and retreat control; 500 vehicles are still below real-time simulation.",
  "changes": [
    "Removed half/quarter-speed candidate grids. Compute a braking profile from the checked free arc and retain its remaining distance while blocked.",
    "When no full forecast is feasible, execute a physically clear maximum-braking step instead of an instantaneous speed reset.",
    "Cull forecast pairs with enclosing circles before detailed geometry; reuse exact repeated stationary/first poses within a control slice.",
    "Copy only changed occupancy regions into pooled search contexts. Revalidate only changed corridor segments.",
    "Share directed segment costs and regional clearance proofs across destinations/search contexts; a changed smoothing segment does not erase unrelated settled Dijkstra nodes.",
    "Keep checked parking/passage/return plans through temporary obstruction and distant construction. Actual local obstruction, changed orders or wait cycles invalidate them.",
    "Attack and attack-move obey live HP thresholds, including queued/proposed orders and early group prefixes. Manual movement remains available.",
    "All production navigation changes are independent of mission IDs and camera state."
  ],
